# This fixture needs a TRACKED .claude/settings.local.json: report/v5 emits
# local-hooks-present only for a tracked file, and an untracked one belongs in
# Local environment notes instead. Many developers carry a global
# core.excludesFile rule for that path, so re-include it here, where a
# directory-level rule outranks the global one.
!.claude/settings.local.json
